{
  "id": "b2-e13-technology-in-the-home",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Technology in the home",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what technology do you use most at home?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, could you live without your phone for a week?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what was the last piece of technology you bought?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think technology makes our lives easier?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e13-a1",
            "b2-e13-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people using technology at home. Compare the photographs, and say what the advantages and disadvantages of this technology might be.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, would you like to have a house full of technology? Why or why not?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e13-b1",
            "b2-e13-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people using technology in different ways. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think children should use technology at home? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways technology is changing family life, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e13-technology-in-the-home",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these changes affect family life?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e13-technology-in-the-home",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which has had the greatest effect on families?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about technology at home.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people think that technology has made family members spend less time together. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think children should have rules about technology at home?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you worry about who can see information about your family online?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it a good idea for elderly people to learn to use new technology?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you think a home will be like in fifty years?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e13-technology-in-the-home/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
